= January 2025 — Two radical-right electorates

Braun leaves Konfederacja with a parliamentary seat and his own electoral
vehicle. Lewica must decide whether to distinguish his movement from Mentzen's
party, hold the whole federation responsible, or monitor both successor camps.

- @braun_isolate
- @braun_attack_all
- @braun_watch

